{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375407882,"sessionID":"ses_f25503d28ffewqHO7ZhKHXxBzU","part":{"id":"prt_0dab0b0f4001swSEuwNxTnNTul","messageID":"msg_0dab053a00016TD34jbzfpJhO3","sessionID":"ses_f25503d28ffewqHO7ZhKHXxBzU","type":"text","text":"The main scene already has an ally and two hostiles in the correct groups, so it provides a useful targeting check. I’ll use a base range of 50 pixels, giving the ally’s range-2 stats a 100-pixel detection radius. The target finder also needs to connect through the child node directly, because its `_ready()` runs before the battle unit’s `onready` variables are initialized.\n","time":{"start":1790375407860,"end":1790375407862},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_047b478f67d5fbf9016ab6f5eb9eec87d29549e9acd9bc85ca","phase":"commentary"}}}}
